            "review_title": "Review at Sinjeon Tokbokki",
            "review_text": "John\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam1 contribution\n0\nThey are thief, stealing our money by their special tricks ! Be careful !\nMar 2020\nBe careful about this Restaurant. \nThey are promoting as \"Spicy Noodles with Beef\" .. and they put that photo online for this soup, as you can see big amount of meat inside! But after we order the soup to home, I tried very much to find beef inside , I could only find that 2 small pieces in entire soup.\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten March 10, 2020",
