            "review_text": "Randall S\n24 contributions\n0\nThey are CHEATERS !!!\nOct 2019\nWe ordered 4 Beef Soups from District 7 branch for delivery to home ..But ONLY 2 of the boxes were full, the other 2 soups were half-half divided into 2 more boxes... Additionally, Beef Soups does NOT CONTAIN ANY BEEF !! I could find only 2 very small (less than 0,5 cm) beefs inside the soup.....Hey You Cheaters; if you don't have enough beef soup, YOU MUST SAY \"It is FINISHED\" to the customer.. You cannot cheat people and take their money by this way !!!\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nWritten October 11, 2019",
