            "review_title": "Review at Sinjeon Tokbokki",
            "review_text": "Jay\n8 contributions\n1\nPoor service.\nNov 2017 • Friends\nThe quality of food, overall atmosphere is fine. \nHowever the server made me very upset.\n\nI went there with 1 more korean and 1 vietnamese staff.\nWe ordered menu in korean, english, and also vietnamese langauge with\nfinger-point too. \n\nThe server nodded and said she had our orders.\n\n2 out of 3 ordered dishes were ready after 20~30mins,\nbut she forgot 1 order and at that time my party almost finished the dishes.\nSo I ordered 1 menu again and we all had to wait and wasted more time there.\n\nThe manager didn't appear and didn't say sorry.\n\nI don't blame on the server but the poor service from the manager level.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten January 4, 2018",
